  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-missing-ice-cube-v2.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "57ef51960610cdd85e1fee5c9c5ba689c315e4df42e2329da339bb8f19a59a18",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f756e31dd5ebf984d31bcf3b585163bbe5dc2f141a0ae8c5309e36569bcf793c",
      "text": "Wukong and the\nMissing Ice Cube",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b209d5051ac477ceb73bf6f41ef65f79d4c8ae7db8867cd2742c2a3964482c60",
      "text": "Wukong takes an ice cube\nfrom the freezer.\nBrr! It is cold and hard.\nHe puts it on a little tray.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6a4fdb9e50c291208c788a9a69d04a15eb429561e061e8046282fb187749cb01",
      "text": "“You can be my ice ship,”\nsays Wukong.\n“Ao Bing and I will make you\na flag!”\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09a5cfa58fd9e0342d2ee682431b110d1ab01403cc4fc74fdb867c5196c06f6c",
      "text": "Wukong and Ao Bing draw\na flag.\nThey color it slowly\nand carefully.\nThat takes a long, long time.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "89655253efec1701b19749c03ef0253cf191ee8d531ed44851c6c50802ab5f8c",
      "text": "He runs back with the flag.\nThe ice cube is gone!\nOnly a puddle and a tiny bit\nof ice are left.\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bcfc68b3e3120e71bd4a46e7e2a310a48586725947c64650b16e7c0abdb10d2a",
      "text": "Wukong gets his\nmagnifying glass.\n“Who took my ice cube?”\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c1afcb5c5d9830f75503ad82f10b584197ca284f97a3609294bda5287f5bd1d8",
      "text": "He looks under the table.\nHe looks in the sink.\nHe even looks inside his\nown shoe!\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c6232bca8627cd8c648f34f70d145db23626d3bcdf1a7727ea1018a21293fae7",
      "text": "Ao Bing looks closely at\nthe tray.\n“Here is the last bit of ice,”\nhe says.\n“It is getting smaller\nand smaller.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2fbff555c18ee342a58245f1ac7ae58ef08867a965e33557aeb47f4f9bd642e5",
      "text": "“The kitchen is warm,” says\nAo Bing.\n“When ice gets warm, it melts\ninto water.”\nThe ice did not run away.\nIt changed!\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fe4d71da5847e4f7b811b0b806e2343dc4585b1c8e1a829a4620be75eafb71c8",
      "text": "They watch the tiny bit\nof ice.\nDrip… drip… It melts away.\nNow it is all water.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8b153eb89dca2211c3ec13aab1b16a9048c4b52e7b0f53aab20d155d0cbd7580",
      "text": "“Ice is solid. You can hold it,”\nsays Ao Bing.\n“Water is liquid. It runs.”\nWukong tips the tray a tiny\nbit. The water slides!\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95a445a5555f312ebf898dbe2a27e457c7520183a0261fff9bfe6e8b901ae2d5",
      "text": "“Can it be ice again?”\nasks Wukong.\n“Cold can freeze it,”\nsays Sandy.\nThey pour the water into a\nfish mold.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dfdd9a872d7125a2219e8a9c0d4acc4af9f72055de8d6b001ccea117c11e629e",
      "text": "Sandy puts the mold in\nthe freezer.\nIt is very, very cold in there.\n“Now we wait until tomorrow.”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7f0576ef19d7d51c89cffae7b8dc683cfb839742c00b7dc205279453b9f37607",
      "text": "That night, Wukong tiptoes to\nthe freezer.\n“Good night, water,”\nhe whispers.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "98b100f57673e76c856c3602c23a732e36d0ad53eb5786b6325fdd162746cceb",
      "text": "The next morning, they open\nthe freezer.\nThe water froze!\nNow it is a little ice fish.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a358b748ca1d0af97657659b096935a2bdd3babac698fc88e25dd6dbe78c8ec9",
      "text": "“Case closed!” says Wukong.\nHis case card shows ice,\nwater, ice again.\nSandy puts the ice fish back.\nWukong keeps his magnifying\nglass for next time.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
